      <ul><li><a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/13/elevenlabs-new-app-combines-meeting-note-taking-and-dictation-for-teams/" rel="noopener">TechCrunch</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
